msgid "Select if you want the inverse navbar style."
msgstr "選取是否需要反向導覽列樣式。"

msgid "Navbar"
msgstr "導覽列"

msgid "Navbar Position"
msgstr "導覽列位置"

msgid "Determines where the navbar is positioned on the page."
msgstr "判定導覽列在頁面上的放置位置。"

msgid "Normal"
msgstr "標準的"

msgid "Static Top"
msgstr "靜態頂端"

msgid "Fixed Top"
msgstr "固定頂端"

msgid "Fixed Bottom"
msgstr "固定底端"

msgid "None"
msgstr "無"

msgid ".well (normal)"
msgstr ".well（一般）"

msgid ".well-sm (small)"
msgstr ".well-sm（小）"

msgid ".well-lg (large)"
msgstr ".well-lg（大）"

msgid "Enable the <code>.well</code>, <code>.well-sm</code> or <code>.well-lg</code> classes for specified regions."
msgstr "為指定的區域啟用 <code>.well</code>、<code>.well-sm</code> 或 <code>.well-lg</code> 類別。"

msgid "Region Wells"
msgstr "區域 Well"

msgid "Bootstrap Wells"
msgstr "Bootstrap Well"

msgid "Colorize Buttons"
msgstr "著色按鈕"

msgid "Adds classes to buttons based on their text value."
msgstr "根據其文字值，將類別新增至按鈕。"

msgid "Buttons"
msgstr "按鈕"

msgid "hook_bootstrap_colorize_text_alter()"
msgstr "hook_bootstrap_colorize_text_alter()"

msgid "Iconize Buttons"
msgstr "圖示化按鈕"

msgid "Adds icons to buttons based on the text value"
msgstr "根據文字值，將圖示新增至按鈕。"

msgid "hook_bootstrap_iconize_text_alter()"
msgstr "hook_bootstrap_iconize_text_alter()"

msgid "Default button size"
msgstr "預設按鈕大小"

msgid "Defines the Bootstrap Buttons specific size"
msgstr "定義「Bootstrap 按鈕」特定大小"

msgid "Extra Small"
msgstr "特小"

msgid "Small"
msgstr "小"

msgid "Large"
msgstr "大"

msgid "Fluid container"
msgstr "非固定儲存器"

msgid "Uses the <code>.container-fluid</code> class instead of <code>.container</code>."
msgstr "使用 <code>.container-fluid</code> 類別，而非 <code>.container</code>。"

msgid "Container"
msgstr "儲存器"

msgid "Automatically remove error classes when values have been entered"
msgstr "在值被輸入時，自動移除錯誤類別"

msgid "If an element has a <code>.has-error</code> class attached to it, enabling this will automatically remove that class when a value is entered."
msgstr "如果元素附加了 <code>.has-error</code> 類別，則在值輸入後，啟用此選項將自動移除該類別。"

msgid "Forms"
msgstr "表單"

msgid "Make required elements display as an error"
msgstr "讓必要元素顯示為錯誤"

msgid "If an element in a form is required, enabling this will always display the element with a <code>.has-error</code> class. This turns the element red and helps in usability for determining which form elements are required to submit the form."
msgstr "如果表單中的元素是必要元素，則啟用此選項將一律顯示元素具有 <code>.has-error</code> 類別。這會將元素變成紅色並提供可用性協助，以判定需要哪些表單元素才能提交表單。"

msgid "Smart form descriptions (via Tooltips)"
msgstr "智慧型表單說明（透過工具提示）"

msgid "Convert descriptions into tooltips (must be enabled) automatically based on certain criteria. This helps reduce the, sometimes unnecessary, amount of noise on a page full of form elements."
msgstr "根據特定準則自動將說明轉換為工具提示（必須為已啟用）。頁面上充滿表單元素時，這有助於減少（有時候是多餘的）雜訊數量。"

msgid "Smart form descriptions allowed (HTML) tags"
msgstr "智慧型表單說明容許的 (HTML) 標籤"

msgid "Prevents descriptions from becoming tooltips by checking for HTML not in the list above (i.e. links). Separate by commas. To disable this filtering criteria, leave an empty value."
msgstr "透過確認 HTML 不在上述清單中（亦即鏈結）來防止說明變成工具提示。以逗點區隔。若要停用此過濾準則，請保留空值。"

msgid "Smart form descriptions maximum character limit"
msgstr "智慧型表單說明字元數上限"

msgid "Prevents descriptions from becoming tooltips by checking the character length of the description (HTML is not counted towards this limit). To disable this filtering criteria, leave an empty value."
msgstr "透過檢查說明的字元長度（HTML 不計入此限制）來防止說明變成工具提示。若要停用此過濾準則，請保留空值。"

msgid "Images in Bootstrap 3 can be made responsive-friendly via the addition of the <code>.img-responsive</code> class. This applies <code>max-width: 100%;</code> and <code>height: auto;</code> to the image so that it scales nicely to the parent element."
msgstr "您可以透過新增 <code>.img-responsive</code> 類別，讓 Bootstrap 3 中的影像成為回應式影像。這會將 <code>max-width: 100%;</code> 和 <code>height: auto;</code> 套用至影像，讓它根據母元素巧妙地縮放。"

msgid "Images"
msgstr "圖片"

msgid "Default image shape"
msgstr "預設影像形狀"

msgid "Add classes to an <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> element to easily style images in any project."
msgstr "將類別新增至 <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> 元素，以在任何專案中輕鬆設定影像樣式。"

msgid "Rounded"
msgstr "圓角"

msgid "Circle"
msgstr "空心圓"

msgid "Thumbnail"
msgstr "縮圖"

msgid "Image Shapes"
msgstr "影像形狀"

msgid "Bordered table"
msgstr "加上邊框的表格"

msgid "Add borders on all sides of the table and cells."
msgstr "在表格和資料格的每一側加上邊框。"

msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表格"

msgid "Condensed table"
msgstr "壓縮表格"

msgid "Make tables more compact by cutting cell padding in half."
msgstr "將資料格行距切成兩半，讓表格更精簡。"

msgid "Hover rows"
msgstr "動態顯示列"

msgid "Enable a hover state on table rows."
msgstr "在表格列上啟用動態顯示狀態。"

msgid "Responsive tables"
msgstr "回應式表格"

msgid "Wraps tables with <code>.table-responsive</code> to make them horizontally scroll when viewing them on devices under 768px. When viewing on devices larger than 768px, you will not see a difference in the presentational aspect of these tables. The <code>Automatic</code> option will only apply this setting for front-end facing tables, not the tables in administrative areas."
msgstr "包裝具有 <code>.table-responsive</code> 的表格，這樣在像素小於 768px 的裝置上檢視表格時，可以讓表格水平捲動。在像素大於 768px 的裝置上檢視表格時，您看不到這些表格的呈現外觀比例有差異。<code>自動</code>選項將僅為面向前端的表格（而不是行政區域中的表格）套用此設定。"

msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "自動化"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "停用"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "啟用"

msgid "Striped rows"
msgstr "條紋列"

msgid "Add zebra-striping to any table row within the <code>&lt;tbody&gt;</code>."
msgstr "將斑馬條紋新增至 <code>&lt;tbody&gt;</code> 內的任何表格列。"

msgid "<strong>Note:</strong> jQuery UI dialog options will be mapped to Bootstrap modal options whenever possible, however they always take precedent over any global Bootstrap modal options set here for compatibility reasons."
msgstr "<strong>附註：</strong>jQuery UI 對話框選項將盡可能對映至 Bootstrap 限制模式選項，不過，由於相容性原因，它們一律優先於這裡設定的任何廣域 Bootstrap 限制模式選項。"

msgid "These are global options. Each modal can independently override desired settings by appending the option name to <code>data-</code>. Example: <code>data-backdrop=\"false\"</code>."
msgstr "這些是廣域選項。 每一個限制模式可以透過將選項名稱附加至 <code>data-</code> 來獨立置換所需的設定。範例：<code>data-backing=\"false\"</code>。"

msgid "animation"
msgstr "動畫"

msgid "Apply a CSS fade transition to modals."
msgstr "將 CSS 淡出轉換套用至限制模式。"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "選項"

msgid "backdrop"
msgstr "背景"

msgid "Includes a modal-backdrop element. Alternatively, specify <code>static</code> for a backdrop which doesn't close the modal on click."
msgstr "併入限制模式背景元素。或者，您也可以為背景指定 <code>static</code>，這樣在按一下時就不會關閉限制模式。"

msgid "Static"
msgstr "靜態"

msgid "Modals are streamlined, but flexible, dialog prompts with the minimum required functionality and smart defaults. See <a href=\":url\" target=\"_blank\">Bootstrap Modals</a> for more documentation."
msgstr "限制模式已簡化，但很靈活，對話框會提示所需的最少功能並且具有智慧型預設值。 如需其他說明文件，請參閱 <a href=\":url\" target=\"_blank\">Bootstrap 限制模式</a>。"

msgid "Enable Bootstrap Modals"
msgstr "啟用 Bootstrap 限制模式"

msgid "focusInput"
msgstr "focusInput"

msgid "Enabling this focuses on the first available and visible input found in the modal after it's opened. If no element is found, the close button (if visible) is focused instead."
msgstr "啟用此項會在開啟限制模式之後，將焦點放在限制模式中找到的第一個可用及可見輸入上。 如果找不到任何元素，則會改為聚焦於關閉按鈕（如果可見）。"

msgid "jQuery UI Dialog Bridge"
msgstr "jQuery UI 對話框橋接器"

msgid "Enabling this replaces the core/jquery.ui.dialog dependency in the core/drupal.dialog library with a jQuery UI Dialog widget bridge. This bridge adds support to Bootstrap Modals so that it may interpret jQuery UI Dialog functionality."
msgstr "啟用此項會以 jQuery UI 對話框小組件橋接器來取代 core/drupal.dialog 程式庫中的 core/jquery.ui.dialog 相依關係。此橋接器新增了對「Bootstrap 限制模式」的支援，使其可以解譯「jQuery UI 對話框」功能。"

msgid "keyboard"
msgstr "鍵盤"

msgid "Closes the modal when escape key is pressed."
msgstr "按下跳出鍵時關閉限制模式。"

msgid "selectText"
msgstr "selectText"

msgid "Enabling this selects the text of the first available and visible input found after it has been focused."
msgstr "啟用此項會選取找到的第一個可用及可見輸入（在聚焦之後）的文字。 "

msgid "show"
msgstr "顯示"

msgid "Shows the modal when initialized."
msgstr "起始設定時顯示限制模式。"

msgid "Default modal size"
msgstr "預設限制模式大小"

msgid "Defines the modal size between the default, <code>modal-sm</code> and <code>modal-lg</code>."
msgstr "定義預設值、<code>modal-sm</code> 與 <code>modal-lg</code> 之間的限制模式大小。"

msgid "These are global options. Each popover can independently override desired settings by appending the option name to <code>data-</code>. Example: <code>data-animation=\"false\"</code>."
msgstr "這些是廣域選項。 每一個蹦現框都可以透過將選項名稱附加至 <code>data-</code> 來獨立置換所需的設定。範例：<code>data-animation=\"false\"</code>。"

msgid "Apply a CSS fade transition to the popover."
msgstr "將 CSS 淡出轉換套用至蹦現框。"

msgid "autoClose"
msgstr "autoClose"

msgid "If enabled, the active popover will automatically close when it loses focus, when a click occurs anywhere in the DOM (outside the popover), the escape key (ESC) is pressed or when another popover is opened."
msgstr "如果已啟用，則作用中的蹦現畫面會在下列情況下自動關閉：當其失去焦點時、在 DOM（蹦現畫面外部）中的任何位置按一下時、按下跳出鍵 (ESC) 時或開啟另一個蹦現視窗時。"

msgid "container"
msgstr "儲存器"

msgid "Appends the popover to a specific element. Example: <code>body</code>. This option is particularly useful in that it allows you to position the popover in the flow of the document near the triggering element - which will prevent the popover from floating away from the triggering element during a window resize."
msgstr "將蹦現框附加至特定元素。範例：<code>body</code>。此選項特別有用，讓您可以在文件流程中將蹦現框放置在觸發元素附近 - 這將防止在調整視窗大小期間蹦現框浮動離開觸發元素。"

msgid "content"
msgstr "內容"

msgid "Default content value if <code>data-content</code> or <code>data-target</code> attributes are not present."
msgstr "如果 <code>data-content</code> 或 <code>data-target</code> 屬性不存在，則為預設內容值。"

msgid "delay"
msgstr "延遲"

msgid "The amount of time to delay showing and hiding the popover (in milliseconds). Does not apply to manual trigger type."
msgstr "延遲顯示及隱藏蹦現框的時間量（以毫秒為單位）。不適用於手動觸發類型。"

msgid "Add small overlays of content, like those on the iPad, to any element for housing secondary information."
msgstr "將小型內容套版（如 iPad 上的那些套版）新增至任何用於存放輔助資訊的元素。"

msgid "Enable Bootstrap Popovers"
msgstr "啟用 Bootstrap 蹦現框"

msgid "Elements that have the <code>data-toggle=&quot;popover&quot;</code> attribute set will automatically initialize the popover upon page load. <div class='alert alert-warning alert-sm'><strong>WARNING:</strong> This feature can sometimes impact performance. Disable if pages appear to hang after load.</div>"
msgstr "已設定 <code>data-toggle=&quot;popover&quot;</code> 屬性的元素將在頁面載入時自動起始設定蹦現框。<div class='alert alert-warning alert-sm'><strong>警告：</strong>這項特性有時會影響效能。如果頁面在載入之後似乎當掉，則予以停用。</div>"

msgid "HTML"
msgstr "HTML"

msgid "Insert HTML into the popover. If false, jQuery's text method will be used to insert content into the DOM. Use text if you're worried about XSS attacks."
msgstr "將 HTML 插入蹦現框。如果為 False，則會使用 jQuery 的文字方法，將內容插入 DOM。如果擔心 XSS 攻擊，請使用文字。"

msgid "placement"
msgstr "放置位置"

msgid "Where to position the popover. When <code>auto</code> is specified, it will dynamically reorient the popover. For example, if placement is <code>auto left</code>, the popover will display to the left when possible, otherwise it will display right."
msgstr "蹦現框的放置位置。若已指定 <code>auto</code>，它將動態重新定位蹦現框。例如，如果放置為 <code>auto left</code>，則會盡可能將蹦現框顯示在左側，否則它將顯示在右側。"

msgid "top"
msgstr "頂端"

msgid "bottom"
msgstr "底部"

msgid "left"
msgstr "左"

msgid "right"
msgstr "右"

msgid "auto"
msgstr "auto"

msgid "auto top"
msgstr "auto top"

msgid "auto bottom"
msgstr "auto bottom"

msgid "auto left"
msgstr "auto left"

msgid "auto right"
msgstr "auto right"

msgid "selector"
msgstr "選取器"

msgid "If a selector is provided, tooltip objects will be delegated to the specified targets. In practice, this is used to enable dynamic HTML content to have popovers added."
msgstr "如果提供了選取器，則工具提示物件將委派給指定的目標。實際上，使用此選項，可讓動態內容 HTML 內容新增蹦現框。"

msgid "Issue #4215"
msgstr "問題 #4215"

msgid "JSFiddle Example"
msgstr "JSFiddle 範例"

msgid "title"
msgstr "標題"

msgid "Default title value if <code>title</code> attribute isn't present."
msgstr "如果 <code>title</code> 屬性不存在，則為預設標題值。"

msgid "trigger"
msgstr "觸發"

msgid "How a popover is triggered."
msgstr "如何觸發蹦現框。"

msgid "click"
msgstr "按一下"

msgid "hover"
msgstr "移至"

msgid "focus"
msgstr "焦點"

msgid "manual"
msgstr "手動"

msgid "Auto-close on document click"
msgstr "按一下文件時自動關閉"

msgid "Will automatically close the current popover if a click occurs anywhere else other than the popover element."
msgstr "如果在蹦現框元素之外的任何其他位置按一下，將自動關閉現行蹦現框。"

msgid "These are global options. Each tooltip can independently override desired settings by appending the option name to <code>data-</code>. Example: <code>data-animation=\"false\"</code>."
msgstr "這些是廣域選項。 每一個工具提示都可以透過將選項名稱附加至 <code>data-</code> 來獨立置換所需的設定。範例：<code>data-animation=\"false\"</code>。"

msgid "Apply a CSS fade transition to the tooltip."
msgstr "將 CSS 淡出轉換套用至工具提示。"

msgid "Appends the tooltip to a specific element. Example: <code>body</code>."
msgstr "將工具提示附加至特定元素。範例：<code>body</code>。"

msgid "The amount of time to delay showing and hiding the tooltip (in milliseconds). Does not apply to manual trigger type."
msgstr "延遲顯示及隱藏工具提示的時間量（以毫秒為單位）。不適用於手動觸發類型。"

msgid "Inspired by the excellent jQuery.tipsy plugin written by Jason Frame; Tooltips are an updated version, which don't rely on images, use CSS3 for animations, and data-attributes for local title storage. See <a href=\":url\" target=\"_blank\">Bootstrap tooltips</a> for more documentation."
msgstr "靈感源自 Jason Frame 所撰寫的傑出 jQuery.tipsy 外掛程式；工具提示是已更新的版本，不依賴影像，將 CSS3 用於動畫，以及將資料屬性用於本端標題儲存體。 如需其他說明文件，請參閱 <a href=\":url\" target=\"_blank\">Bootstrap 工具提示</a>。"

msgid "Enable Bootstrap Tooltips"
msgstr "啟用 Bootstrap 工具提示"

msgid "Elements that have the <code>data-toggle=&quot;tooltip&quot;</code> attribute set will automatically initialize the tooltip upon page load. <div class='alert alert-warning alert-sm'><strong>WARNING:</strong> This feature can sometimes impact performance. Disable if pages appear to &quot;hang&quot; after load.</div>"
msgstr "已設定 <code>data-toggle=&quot;tooltip&quot;</code> 屬性的元素將在頁面載入時自動起始設定工具提示。<div class='alert alert-warning alert-sm'><strong>警告：</strong>這項特性有時會影響效能。如果頁面在載入之後似乎「當掉」，則予以停用。</div>"

msgid "Insert HTML into the tooltip. If false, jQuery's text method will be used to insert content into the DOM. Use text if you're worried about XSS attacks."
msgstr "將 HTML 插入工具提示。如果為 False，則會使用 jQuery 的文字方法，將內容插入 DOM。如果擔心 XSS 攻擊，請使用文字。"

msgid "Where to position the tooltip. When <code>auto</code> is specified, it will dynamically reorient the tooltip. For example, if placement is <code>auto left</code>, the tooltip will display to the left when possible, otherwise it will display right."
msgstr "工具提示的放置位置。若已指定 <code>auto</code>，它將動態重新定位工具提示。例如，如果放置為 <code>auto left</code>，則會盡可能將工具提示顯示在左側，否則它將顯示在右側。"

msgid "If a selector is provided, tooltip objects will be delegated to the specified targets."
msgstr "如果提供了選取器，則工具提示物件將委派給指定的目標。"

msgid "How a tooltip is triggered."
msgstr "如何觸發工具提示。"

